  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MICCA: Support to the Spanish Authorities in the Implementation of Circular Migration Programs (Honduras-Spain)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is designed to support the Spanish Directorate General for Migration in introducing innovative to one of the biggest state-run labour mobility schemes -the GECCO Programme. Within this initiative IOM will develop an orientation and information programme aimed at potential migrant workers from Honduras, with the aim of accompanying them throughout the entire migration cycle: prior to their employment, prior to their departure from the country of origin and before returning to it.</narrative>
  </description>
